msgid "Curated memory uses the backend-neutral `Memory` contract from ADR-005. A configured backend is the authoritative durable store for that memory. Prompt assembly, consolidation, governance, and feedback remain lifecycle-policy concerns above the storage implementation; issue [\\#6850](https://github.com/zeroclaw-labs/zeroclaw/issues/6850) tracks that boundary."
