#: src/architecture/decisions/ADR-008-goal-mode-control-plane-and-usage-accounting.md
msgid "Delegation and background work must respect the same lifecycle and usage boundaries. Work that cannot report completion and usage back to the owning goal cannot safely participate in goal mode."
